# ai_sector_monitor - public repo whitelist (.gitignore)
# Only the generated static site (docs/) and a few public docs are tracked.
# Internal code, data/, _ledger/, .env, kabu-derived files are NEVER committed.
#
# 2026-09-06: docs/ is now GitHub-Pages-only (the internal changelog that used to
# live at docs/作業ログ.md was moved to 作業ログ.md at the project root to remove
# the folder-name collision). Kept the *.md exclusion below anyway as defense in
# depth in case a stray markdown file ever ends up under docs/ by mistake.
*
!.gitignore
!README_public.md
!docs/
!docs/**
docs/**/*.tmp
docs/*.md
docs/**/*.md
